{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have a taste of Pardon My French Toast, a 3D platformer featuring a toast who can spread sweets on his face to get funny abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563230/extras/PMFT_Intro02.gif?t=1747034341\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What you will find in this demo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 full levels: Honey Cakes &amp; Crocodile lake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various abilities, including &quot;<strong>honey toast</strong>&quot; which helps you stick to things and climb walls &amp; &quot;<strong>hardened chocolate</strong>&quot; which helps breaking stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access to the HUB: Welcome to Jam Session's Cruise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet some friendly toasts along the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you find 100% of the collectibles?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563230/extras/PMFT_Chocolate.gif?t=1747034341\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563230?t=1747034341","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563230/00af09029dd187d014b491aca913122bcace98a0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747034341","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563230/cec77afd9672603639fb55404544ddca8cc1fc3c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747034341","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563230/cec77afd9672603639fb55404544ddca8cc1fc3c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747034341","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","d